{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id417388668"}, "name":{"label":"sfr.808"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-20T02:04:24-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.8"}, "id":{"label":"14688581942"}, "title":{"label":"Not useful"}, "content":{"label":"The app flags MSG as bad even though the science is inconclusive, including one of the cited sources in the app. That made me doubt it. Then I looked at other products I’ve compared in the past, and it shows sugar as low impact for one product but flags another even the sugar is higher for the first. These apps are about trust, and unfortunately I’ve lost trust in the methodology.\n\nThere needs to be a user rating and / or user commentary to adjust for the automated rating that is biased based on the flawed methodology.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1092799236&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
