{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1356202469"}, "name":{"label":"Sodium sin"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-15T09:03:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.8"}, "id":{"label":"14670071944"}, "title":{"label":"Mr. Salty"}, "content":{"label":"You give high scores on some things like a lasagna I saw at Aldi. It scored a 90 but the sodium was so high. 1030 mg per cup. I just don’t understand how you can score something that high. Sodium is a leading cause of high blood pressure among other things.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1092799236&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id112423710"}, "name":{"label":"tlmorgan751"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-15T08:02:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.8"}, "id":{"label":"14669860467"}, "title":{"label":"Love my Yuka app!!!"}, "content":{"label":"It’s a staple to have in your phone. My husband and I use it all the time. We even ask each other when we’re shopping, “Did you Yuk it?” because scanning is critical to our goals for CLEAN products and healthy lifestyle! We’ve been telling everyone about this app. Some people already have it and some don’t….We love the Yuka app. We’re hoping Robert Kennedy can maybe communicate with the yuca app and make America healthy again in regards to clean food…..I’m just saying.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1092799236&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1340256763"}, "name":{"label":"GitRedy"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-15T05:08:46-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.8"}, "id":{"label":"14669258476"}, "title":{"label":"A Godsend"}, "content":{"label":"I’m convinced, that in certain stores (gas stations, convenience stores, even grocery stores), not even 10% of food products would be rated good or excellent.  YUKA is becoming a huge contributor to help MAHA! Wish it had been around years ago, thank you to the whole team, you are making a difference! 😛❤️❤️❤️", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1092799236&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
