{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1460523106"}, "name":{"label":"mea7w00d"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-14T04:07:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.8"}, "id":{"label":"14665149661"}, "title":{"label":"Could Be Better"}, "content":{"label":"This app is lazy. Don’t get me wrong, it’s great if you’re just scanning products. However don’t waste your money paying for premium to enable the search.\n\nWhat you get is a mostly unfiltered and unsorted list of random products. For some reason the text is in French. I see nothing in the settings for language choice.\n\nAnd then you’re getting a list of worldwide products. That’s great that Canada has a really good brand of coffee creamer ,but it does nothing for me but waste my time having to search through products not even sold in my country.\n\nBe better Yuka.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1092799236&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
