{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1359974585"}, "name":{"label":"Shy Hussein"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-11T09:29:01-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.8"}, "id":{"label":"14654466794"}, "title":{"label":"Great, however"}, "content":{"label":"I’m not sure why… but the app doesn’t come up for me anymore. The icon is grayed out and I assumed maybe I needed to update so lo and behold, when I pull it up in the App Store it gives me me an update option. I clicked on it and it just keeps spinning. It will not update or doesn’t seem to even start the process. Idk if anyone else is having this issue but I LOVE THIS APP it’s the only form of technology that I trust these days. Not being able to use it really sucks. Someone plz help.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1092799236&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1404053247"}, "name":{"label":"MK17081!"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-11T04:41:09-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.8"}, "id":{"label":"14653472051"}, "title":{"label":"Potential way to make it better"}, "content":{"label":"Been using this app for about a year and a half now and absolutely have no complaints about it. \nHowever i do have a potential suggestion on how to make it better/more personable for the user: have a section on the app where the user can input what their condition/conditions are (endometriosis, PCOS, pre diabetic, diabetes 1,2, etc), so that way they can have general knowledge of the product they are thinking of buying would potentially help their condition or worsen it in the general sence.\n\nI personally have newly diagnosised endometriosis and would absolutely love to have a state of mind when considering buying a potential product that I’m interested in buying would end up making my diagnosis worse or unchanged as I’m still in the process of trying to figure out what works and doesn't work.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1092799236&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
